      "Anusvara before a consonant: n, or m before p, ph, b, bh, m.",
      "A nasal vowel adds n: hoon, main, naheen.",
      "pha for फ, fa for फ़.",
      "ऑ (as in डॉक्टर) is o, like ओ."
